## Design stack (invoke when relevant)
- `frontend-design` + `design-taste-frontend` + `high-end-visual-design` — anti-slop, distinctive composition
- `huashu-design` / `prototype` — hi-fi HTML / exploratory prototypes
- `mobile-ios-design` + `ios-hig-design` + `swiftui-expert-skill` + `swiftui-pro` — native iOS
- `swiftui-performance-audit` + `ios-accessibility` — perf / a11y deepen
- `impeccable` / `ui-ux-pro-max` / `ui-styling` — polish pass
- Brainstorm before creative implementation when the brief is open-ended

## Anti-slop (hard)
No purple-indigo AI defaults, cream+serif terracotta cliché, broadsheet hairlines as default, pill clusters, glow soup, multi-layer shadow stacks, emoji decoration, dashboard clutter on non-dashboard surfaces.

## Gates
- Visual change → respect device proof culture (`make device` + operator screenshot when shipping).
- Before commit: `swift run AtlasCoreChecks` + `cd App && make build`.
- Commits: `feat(ui)|polish(ui)` on local `main` only.
